(7509373, 1198184, 37858, '<td valign="top">I could see this in the top 10, although there is some stiff competition IMHO.</td>', 'I could see this in the top 10, although there is some stiff competition IMHO.', '2017-04-16 03:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7509374, 1198148, 37858, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting image, but there seems to be something unusual about the ocean processing, especially as I look toward the horizon line.  Almost as if there was some selective blurring that went a touch too far in the water.  The sharp white spot on the horizon draws my eye away from the main part of the image.  (Just my 2 cents.)</td>', 'This is an interesting image, but there seems to be something unusual about the ocean processing, especially as I look toward the horizon line.  Almost as if there was some selective blurring that went a touch too far in the water.  The sharp white spot on the horizon draws my eye away from the main part of the image.  (Just my 2 cents.)', '2017-04-16 03:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7509376, 1198181, 37858, '<td valign="top">I like this image, but I''m not sure the texture layer in the sky is a help as it drew my eye away from his face where that beautiful expression is.</td>', 'I like this image, but I''m not sure the texture layer in the sky is a help as it drew my eye away from his face where that beautiful expression is.', '2017-04-16 03:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
