(7509380, 1197587, 37858, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, good lines.  I wish their faces were stationary as the blur takes away from the total image IMHO.  (Just my 2 cents.)</td>', 'Nice lighting, good lines.  I wish their faces were stationary as the blur takes away from the total image IMHO.  (Just my 2 cents.)', '2017-04-16 03:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7509381, 1197959, 37858, '<td valign="top">I hope the fog didn''t burn off while he was waiting.  As for your photo, I like the leading lines and the depth of field.  My eye had no trouble running down the walkway to the photographer and then along the bridge to the background.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I hope the fog didn''t burn off while he was waiting.  As for your photo, I like the leading lines and the depth of field.  My eye had no trouble running down the walkway to the photographer and then along the bridge to the background.  Nicely done.', '2017-04-16 03:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7509382, 1198158, 37858, '<td valign="top">I like the point of view and the back lighting along the road.</td>', 'I like the point of view and the back lighting along the road.', '2017-04-16 03:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7509384, 1197651, 37858, '<td valign="top">I like the tonal range of this image.  There are two things that I think are questionable, though.  The woman''s hand looks like it suffers from excess noise reduction or other processing.  Secondly, unless she is actually smoking that stick, I would have removed it.  Everything else is spot on IMHO.  (Just my 2 cents.)</td>', 'I like the tonal range of this image.  There are two things that I think are questionable, though.  The woman''s hand looks like it suffers from excess noise reduction or other processing.  Secondly, unless she is actually smoking that stick, I would have removed it.  Everything else is spot on IMHO.  (Just my 2 cents.)', '2017-04-16 03:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7509385, 1198137, 37858, '<td valign="top">Beer will do that to you.  Seriously, though, this photo has some excellent interaction from all of them.  Some serious trash on the floor, too.  Good image.</td>', 'Beer will do that to you.  Seriously, though, this photo has some excellent interaction from all of them.  Some serious trash on the floor, too.  Good image.', '2017-04-16 03:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7509386, 1197874, 37858, '<td valign="top">Good eye.  The one thing I would have liked is a bit more sharpening on the facade.  It looks a bit soft to my eye.  Still, I like the image well enough for a 6.</td>', 'Good eye.  The one thing I would have liked is a bit more sharpening on the facade.  It looks a bit soft to my eye.  Still, I like the image well enough for a 6.', '2017-04-16 03:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
