(7509623, 1198080, 37858, '<td valign="top">I love the bokeh at f/5.6.  I''ve been debating whether to buy Canon''s 300mm or 400mm.  This image leads me to believe the 400mm may be the better choice.  (I can''t believe that the "participants" gave this a 5.8462.  Too bad there isn''t a way to compare their votes with their own photos; I bet it would be a joke.)  I''ve always enjoyed your images and the fact that you put detail in your comments.</td>', 'I love the bokeh at f/5.6.  I''ve been debating whether to buy Canon''s 300mm or 400mm.  This image leads me to believe the 400mm may be the better choice.  (I can''t believe that the "participants" gave this a 5.8462.  Too bad there isn''t a way to compare their votes with their own photos; I bet it would be a joke.)  I''ve always enjoyed your images and the fact that you put detail in your comments.', '2017-04-17 02:57:26.000000', NULL, 0),
